    "enUS": {
      "description": "Yeah, I can teach you.  But first I wanna see what moves you have already.\n\nSee that drunk over there at the end of the bar?  Bartleby?  I want you to get his mug.\n\nHah, and if you know Bartleby then you know he won't just give it to you.",
      "summary": "Speak with Bartleby.",
      "title": "Bartleby the Drunk",
